blocks.en:
Teachers and students. Teachers 𝒯 \mathcal{T} are strong ViT-based foundation encoders spanning three pre-training paradigms:
(i) Supervised ViT-B/16 [ 25 ] ;
(ii) DINOv3 (self-supervised) ViT-S/16, ViT-B/16, and ViT-L/16 [ 72 ] ;
(iii) SigLIP2 (contrastive vision-language) ViT-B/16, ViT-L/16, ViT-so400m/16, and ViT-so400m/14@384 [ 76 ] .
B-cos students 𝒮 \mathcal{S} are constructed using the architecture-preserving conversion recipe ( Sec. 3.2 ) and initialized to mirror 𝒯 \mathcal{T} in width, depth, and token layout, enabling one-to-one alignment ( Sec. 4.2 ). As shown in Fig. 4 , the linear patch embedding is replaced by a B-cos convolutional stem with the same overall stride, so the student’s token grid matches the teacher’s (see Sec. A for SigLIP2 so400m/14@384).

blocks.zh:
师生相接. 教师 T\ mathcal{T} 是强大的基于ViT的基础编码器, 跨越三个训练前范式:
(一) 监督VIT-B/16 [25];
(二) DINOv3(自我监督)VIT-S/16、VIT-B/16和VIT-L/16[72];
(三)SigLIP2(相接视觉-语言)VIT-B/16,VIT-L/16,VIT-so400m/16,和VIT-so400m/14@384 [76].
乙科学生 S\ mathcal{S}是使用架构保存转换配方(sec. 3.2)来构建的,并初始化为镜像 T\ mathcal{T}在宽度,深度,和符号布局上,允许一对一对齐(sec. 4.2). 如图4所显示的,线性补丁嵌入被一个B-cos相干所取代,其整体走势相同,因此学生的标志网格与老师相匹配(见Sec. A for SigLIP2 so400m/14@384).
